WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.810
Welcome back, Bayview.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.562
I hope you're ready
for a wild year,

00:00:07.562 --> 00:00:09.272
because it's only the
first day of school

00:00:11.024 --> 00:00:12.442
and one of these four

00:00:12.442 --> 00:00:13.693
made it my last.

